  "description": "THE BOBBOSS CHAIN, arm 2 of 2 — the sword WITHHELD. Identical to `r5-bobboss-fire` in every field but `grants`. The presses still page all fourteen dialogue pages, because paging is what a press does while `Game.freezeObjects` is up; what they cannot do is hit anything, because `useItem` reads `Inventory.getItem(Main.primary)` off an EMPTY slot array. So form 0 never dies, forms 1 and 2 never exist, `Fire` is never spawned, and the ledger keeps only {32,1} — the rock, which the walk armed with its feet. Without this arm, \"the walk ended holding fire\" is not evidence that the sword did anything.",
